{"ref":"BDB, שׁוֹר","hw":"שׁוֹר","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹר</span></big><sub>78</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.18\">Ne 5:18</a> <strong>a head of cattle</strong>, bullock, ox, etc. (often + <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׂה</span>, etc.);—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.3\">Is 1:3</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:35\" href=\"/Exodus.21.35\">Ex 21:35</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:14\" href=\"/Exodus.20.14\">20:17</a> +, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁוָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:12\" href=\"/Hosea.12.12\">Ho 12:12</a>;—usually a single <em>head of cattle</em>, without emphasis on sex (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּקָר</span> coll. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:37\" href=\"/Exodus.21.37\">Ex 21:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:3\" href=\"/Numbers.7.3\">Nu 7:3</a>): as property, spoil of war, etc. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:14\" href=\"/Exodus.20.14\">Ex 20:17</a> (E; Gi v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:13\" href=\"/Exodus.20.13\">14</a>) = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.17\">Dt 5:18</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.14\">Dt 5:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:33\" href=\"/Exodus.21.33\">Ex 21:33</a> (E) ‖ <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.4\">Dt 22:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:37\" href=\"/Exodus.21.37\">Ex 21:37</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּקָר</span> of five head), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:3\" href=\"/Exodus.22.3\">22:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:8\" href=\"/Exodus.22.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:9\" href=\"/Exodus.22.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:29\" href=\"/Exodus.22.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:12\" href=\"/Exodus.23.12\">23:12</a> (all E), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.1\">Dt 22:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:6\" href=\"/Genesis.49.6\">Gn 49:6</a> (poem in J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:31\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.31\">Dt 28:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:4\" href=\"/Judges.6.4\">Ju 6:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.3\">1 S 12:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:3\" href=\"/Job.24.3\">Jb 24:3</a>; as <em>licking up</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לָחַךְ)</span> grass <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:4\" href=\"/Numbers.22.4\">Nu 22:4</a> (J), feeding <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:20\" href=\"/Psalms.106.20\">ψ 106:20</a> (in ref. to golden calf), cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.25\">Is 7:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.20\">32:20</a>; lowing <a data-ref=\"Job 6:5\" href=\"/Job.6.5\">Jb 6:5</a>; as intelligent <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.3\">Is 1:3</a>, vicious (goring <span dir=\"rtl\">נָגַח</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:28\" href=\"/Exodus.21.28\">Ex 21:28</a><sup>(×3)</sup> + 11 times <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21\" href=\"/Exodus.21\">Ex 21</a> (E); used in ploughing <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.10\">Dt 22:10</a>, threshing <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.4\">25:4</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.4\">Pr 14:4</a>; drawing wagon <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:3\" href=\"/Numbers.7.3\">Nu 7:3</a> (P; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּקָר</span> coll.); <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּנֵי שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.10\">Ez 1:10</a>; specif. of male †<a data-ref=\"Job 21:10\" href=\"/Job.21.10\">Jb 21:10</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרָה</span>), of female †<a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.28\">Lv 22:28</a> (H), perhaps also <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:17\" href=\"/Numbers.18.17\">Nu 18:17</a> (P), appar. generic <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.19\">Dt 15:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.17\">33:17</a> (poem, fig.); rarely coll. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:6\" href=\"/Genesis.32.6\">Gn 32:6</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאן</span>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:19\" href=\"/Exodus.34.19\">Ex 34:19</a>—cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.26\">Lv 27:26</a> (P)—<a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:21\" href=\"/Joshua.6.21\">Jos 6:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:24\" href=\"/Joshua.7.24\">7:24</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.3\">1 S 15:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.19\">22:19</a>; †as slaughtered <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.22\">Pr 7:22</a>, for food <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.34\">1 S 14:34</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (but v b read <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֶת־)אֲשֶׁר</span> with 𝔊 Th We Dr al.), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.19\">1 K 1:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.4\">Dt 14:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.3\">Lv 17:3</a> (H), cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.18\">Ne 5:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(שׁ׳ אֶחָר)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.17\">Pr 15:17</a>; for †sacrifice <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:25\" href=\"/Judges.6.25\">Ju 6:25</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">פַּר־הַשּׁ׳</span>, text strange, cf. GFM), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:32\" href=\"/Psalms.69.32\">ψ 69:32</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹר פָּר</span>, but join <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּר</span> to v b Bae), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.13\">2 S 6:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:12\" href=\"/Hosea.12.12\">Ho 12:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.4\">Lv 9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.18\">18</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.23\">22:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.27\">27</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:11\" href=\"/Numbers.15.11\">Nu 15:11</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.1\">Dt 17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.3\">18:3</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.23\">Lv 7:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.19\">9:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשּׁוֹר זֶבַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.10\">Lv 4:10</a> (P); illicit sacrifice <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.3\">Is 66:3</a>.","next":"BDB, שׁוּר⁴","prev":"BDB, שׁור"}